      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "So turns out this works now - on native ARM! 😂 Which is great for ie Microsoft Surface tablets, or other devices running ARM & Windows natively. However, the requirement for TPM and HVCI means it will not run under VIRTUALIZED Windows 11 Arm 64, via VMWare or Parallels,  because EAC relies on VBS.\n\nI don't imagine this is negotiable since it's probably core components of the anti-cheat. But, worth pointing out.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
